{"slug":"sightengine","name":"Sightengine","description":"Sightengine is a content moderation and media analysis platform that provides developer-friendly APIs to automatically assess, filter, and safeguard user-generated content across images, videos, text, and audio. It offers 150+ moderation classes (nudity, violence, hate, drugs, weapons, self-harm), AI-generated content and deepfake detection (images, video, speech, music), OCR and QR screening, visual search and near-duplicate detection, profile image validation and age estimation, plus image quality scoring. Built for Trust & Safety at scale, Sightengine delivers fast, accurate, privacy-compliant results with simple SDKs and detailed docs.","icon":"https://storage.googleapis.com/stuff.thingsofbrand.com/sightengine.com/images/imgd_sightengine.png","domain":"sightengine.com","rank":251,"labels":["AI Tools","Security and Identity Tools","Developer Tools","Content and Files","Video and Audio"],"categories":["ai-tools","developer-tools","documents"],"eventsRead":true,"events":[{"n":"Analyze Image","d":"Scan an image with selected moderation models to detect nudity, violence, hate, drugs, weapons, self‑harm, AI‑generated/deepfake content, and other safety issues.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Moderate Image Content","d":"Scan an image for unsafe or disallowed content (nudity, violence, hate, drugs, weapons, self-harm), AI/deepfake detection, OCR/QR issues, profile-image validation, age estimation, and image-quality scoring.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Analyze Image OCR","d":"Run selected moderation and analysis checks on an image and extract text via OCR.","t":"action","k":"hook"}],"recipes":[{"ta":"quo","te":"Receive Incoming Message","aa":"sightengine","ae":"Analyze Image"},{"ta":"google-meet","te":"New Meeting","aa":"sightengine","ae":"Analyze Image"},{"ta":"jibble","te":"New Clock In","aa":"sightengine","ae":"Analyze Image"},{"ta":"recras","te":"New Booking Created","aa":"sightengine","ae":"Analyze Image"